# Files that belong in the repository but not in the distributed plugin.
#
# The plugin checker rejects hidden files outright, and flags a test harness for
# the WordPress coding standards it is deliberately not written to (it stubs
# WordPress rather than running inside it). None of it is needed to run the
# plugin, so none of it ships.
.git
.gitignore
.distignore
bin
dist
docs
tests
README.md
